    "overview": "Đỉnh Linh Sơn Vân Hải delivers a celestial cultivation sanctuary for Vietnamese TikTok LIVE streaming. Features layered 2.5D painted art, 40 visible cultivators, 180 pooled Xianxia VFX sprites, procedural guzheng and thunder sound design, and an operator UI themed in Vân Ngọc & Kim Quang.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Celadon Jade and Celestial Gold ethereal palette with deep astral mist.",
      "Quiet porcelain cloud and panel paper operator surfaces with WCAG AA compliance.",
      "Strict zero-allocation per-frame pooling for 180 effect sprites and 40 visible cultivators."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Cultivation Rule",
        "body": "Preserve the 40-cultivator ceiling, 180-particle pool, 1080×1920 portrait frame, and deterministic capture hooks.",
        "section": "architecture"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** keep all WebAudio sound synthesis bounded within 10 active polyphony voices.",
      "**Do** ensure all body, label, and control copy exceeds WCAG AA contrast (≥ 4.5:1).",
      "**Do** retain deterministic ?capture=1 behavior and prefers-reduced-motion support."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** allocate objects or closures in Phaser update() loops.",
      "**Don't** allow horizontal scroll on 1440×1100 desktop or 390×844 mobile viewports.",
      "**Don't** touch server or shared packages outside your assigned ownership."
    ]
